# {package_name}

Lumis WASM {bundle_name} language bundle.

## Install

```sh
npm install @lumis-sh/lumis {package_name}
```

## Usage

The package exports the bundle, in Node and in a browser. Each language loads from its package the first time it is used:

```ts
import { createHighlighter } from '@lumis-sh/lumis'
import {variable} from '{package_name}'

const highlighter = await createHighlighter({ languages: [{variable}] })
```
